@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Backhand ladder volleys
Backhand ladder volleys, two minutes. Behind the tape for your volley ladder level: halfway to the
short line, three-quarters of the way, or the short line itself. A metre or so off the side wall,
volleying above the service line without a bounce. Let it bounce if you lose it. Phase two target:
twenty without a break from the three-quarter line.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
12% Racket high. Punch.
50% Shoulders to the side wall.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
